    "inputDescription": "{\"props\":{\"recipes\":[{\"id\":\"s\",\"name\":\"Soup\",\"category\":\"Lunch\"},{\"id\":\"p\",\"name\":\"Pancakes\",\"category\":\"Breakfast\"}]},\"actions\":[{\"type\":\"input\",\"selector\":\"select\",\"value\":\"Lunch\"},{\"type\":\"input\",\"selector\":\"input\",\"value\":\"cake\"}],\"assertions\":[{\"selector\":\"[data-testid=\\\"recipes\\\"] li\",\"property\":\"count\",\"equals\":0},{\"selector\":\"[data-testid=\\\"empty\\\"]\",\"property\":\"text\",\"equals\":\"No matching recipes\"}]}",
